  "cloudChannelsTitle": "Cloud import channels",
  "cloudChannelsNote": "OpenList, WebDAV, Quark Drive (experimental), and the system document picker for OneDrive, Google Drive, and similar services. Channels are entry points only; no accounts or credentials are built in, and real authorization and file access are frozen in static delivery.",
  "mergeRecordsNote": "Strategies for manually merging and syncing original books with reading records are registered in the import wizard; static delivery records them as deferred decisions and does not modify the demo library.",
  "wenkuFormatsNote": "Formats now match the reference project: TXT, EPUB, MOBI, AZW, AZW3, PRC, FB2, PDF, DOC, DOCX, RTF, HTML, Markdown, and ZIP. Legacy binary formats are registered as routes only in static delivery; their decoders stay frozen.",
  "unlockModeTitle": "Static delivery unlocked",
  "unlockModeBody": "The Wenku8 pipeline now uses a real HTTP source. Pure-local mode is still the default and makes zero requests while locked.",
  "wenkuRealSourceNote": "The real source and the demo source share one contract; swapping them at the single injection point leaves pages and compliance untouched.",
  "wenkuEndpointNote": "URLs are built only in the site adapter. No official page-structure docs are public, so path templates must be checked against the live site.",
  "wenkuChallengeNote": "The source asks for an access check. Please finish it on the Wenku8 website; this app does not bypass verification.",
  "wenkuWithdrawnNote": "Content withdrawn for copyright reasons is not listed, cached, or made accessible.",
  "wenkuRateLimitNote": "The source is rate-limiting requests. Please try later and do not keep refreshing.",
  "wenkuUnavailableNote": "Third-party services may change, rate-limit requests, or become temporarily unavailable.",
  "wenkuUpstreamChangedNote": "The source page structure changed. Update the parser against the live public pages; garbled text is never rendered as content.",
  "wenkuNoRelayNote": "No relay, proxy, cookie, login, forged appver, or browser-style UA spoofing is implemented. Access restrictions are not bypassed.",
  "wenkuChapterNote": "Only the single chapter you open is read. No whole-book download, bundling, or redistribution.",
  "wenkuLocalVerifyNote": "Verify locally: flutter pub get, then flutter analyze, flutter test, and flutter run. Check site reachability and page structure first.",
  "wenkuSdkAbsentNote": "This delivery environment has no Flutter/Dart SDK. Compilable source and specs are provided; build and device verification run in your environment.",
  "wenkuPlatformPermissionNote": "Android INTERNET, iOS ATS, and HarmonyOS INTERNET permission skeletons are in place; check them against each platform project template.",
